Linux UAPI provenance
====================

The native.rs C-compatible layouts describe Linux UAPI structures from
include/uapi/drm/i915_drm.h, include/uapi/drm/xe_drm.h, and
include/uapi/linux/perf_event.h. No qmassa or hw-smi implementation was copied.

